Welcome to Mayyattil Waterfront Villa
Nestled along the peaceful backwaters of Narakkal in Vypin, Mayyattil Waterfront Villa is a modern luxury retreat designed for families and groups seeking a serene escape immersed in nature. Surrounded by scenic water views and lush tropical greenery, our villa seamlessly blends modern comfort with the calm, gentle rhythms of coastal Kerala.
Our Story & Vision
Mayyattil Waterfront Villa was created as a sanctuary where families can slow down, reconnect, and create lasting memories. Waking up to gentle waters, feeling the cool backwater breeze, and enjoying private luxury—all while remaining close to top regional attractions—defines the experience we aim to provide.
Why Stay With Us?
Waterfront Tranquility: Wake up to breathtaking waterfront views right outside your door, surrounded by nature and serene landscapes.
Modern Luxury & Comfort: Enjoy spacious, fully air-conditioned suites designed with high-end finishes and modern conveniences to ensure a restful stay.
Family-Friendly Atmosphere: Designed with families in mind, offering generous living spaces, privacy, and a safe, peaceful environment.
Prime Location:
Boche Toddy Pub: Just 5 minutes (550 meters) away for an authentic local food and cultural experience.
Kochi City: Only 12 km away, giving you easy access to urban sight-seeing, dining, and shopping.
Cherai Beach: Located just 13 km away, perfect for sunbathing, swimming, and sunset walks.
Experience True Kerala Hospitality
Whether you are lounging in our air-conditioned suites, exploring local culinary hotspots nearby, or enjoying a quiet evening by the water, Mayyattil Waterfront Villa offers the perfect balance of adventure and relaxation.
We look forward to welcoming you to your home away from home on the Vypin backwaters.